{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"a Chinese coin (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Junk_dollar\" title=\"Junk dollar\">a Chinese coin</a></b> <i>(example pictured)</i> was modified to avoid similarities to the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rising_Sun_Flag\" title=\"Rising Sun Flag\">Japanese rising sun</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Junk_dollar","retrieved":1788258071627},{"title":"Kotaro Tatsumi (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kotaro_Tatsumi\" title=\"Kotaro Tatsumi\">Kotaro Tatsumi</a></b> once volunteered to support leprosy patients in Bangladesh?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kotaro_Tatsumi","retrieved":1788258071631},{"title":"Davis Creek Regional Park (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Davis_Creek_Regional_Park\" title=\"Davis Creek Regional Park\">Davis Creek Regional Park</a></b> was part of a ranch known for its <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thoroughbred\" title=\"Thoroughbred\">Thoroughbred</a> horses?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Davis_Creek_Regional_Park","retrieved":1788258071633},{"title":"Kim Jong-suk (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kim_Jong-suk_(politician)\" title=\"Kim Jong-suk (politician)\">Kim Jong-suk</a></b> is the only person in North Korea with her name, as she is a cousin of the founder of North Korea?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kim_Jong-suk_(politician)","retrieved":1788258071634},{"title":"The Young Lady with the Shiner (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that a two-year-old boy with black eyes was used as a model in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norman_Rockwell\" title=\"Norman Rockwell\">Norman Rockwell</a>'s painting <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Young_Lady_with_the_Shiner\" title=\"The Young Lady with the Shiner\">The Young Lady with the Shiner</a></b></i><span style=\"padding-left:0.15em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">?</span></span>","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Young_Lady_with_the_Shiner","retrieved":1788258071635},{"title":"Titouan Bernicot (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Titouan_Bernicot\" title=\"Titouan Bernicot\">Titouan Bernicot</a></b> founded an organization that grows super corals?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Titouan_Bernicot","retrieved":1788258071637},{"title":"I Can't Say No to the Lonely Girl (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the creator of the manga series <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I_Can't_Say_No_to_the_Lonely_Girl\" title=\"I Can't Say No to the Lonely Girl\">I Can't Say No to the Lonely Girl</a></b></i> used fashion magazines for students as a reference for her character designs?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I_Can't_Say_No_to_the_Lonely_Girl","retrieved":1788258071639},{"title":"Joseph H. Rothenberg (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joseph_H._Rothenberg\" title=\"Joseph H. Rothenberg\">Joseph H. Rothenberg</a></b> co-led the recovery of the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hubble_Space_Telescope\" title=\"Hubble Space Telescope\">Hubble Space Telescope</a> after its primary mirror was polished too flat by 1/40th the thickness of a human hair?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joseph_H._Rothenberg","retrieved":1788258071640},{"title":"Paula Maxa (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paula_Maxa\" title=\"Paula Maxa\">Paula Maxa</a></b> was known as the \"most murdered woman in the world\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paula_Maxa","retrieved":1788258071641},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt8\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwIQ\" data-mw=\"{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;banner&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Banner&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;direction&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;left&quot;},&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Des Moines&quot;},&quot;type&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;dotm&quot;},&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;DesMoinesBanner1.jpg&quot;},&quot;quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;A capitol building with a golden dome, several art institutions and a State Fair each August; these are some of the things awaiting you in Iowa's largest city.&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4523569\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" about=\"#mwt9\" data-mw=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Banner/styles.css&quot;}}\">.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox{color:white;background:rgb(16,16,16);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);border-radius:4px}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h2,.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h3{color:white;border:none;font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.2em;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox a{color:white;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .banner-image{position:relative;max-width:1125px;height:auto;margin-bottom:.6em}.mw-parser-output .banner-image img{max-width:100%;height:auto}.mw-parser-output .banner-box-wide{width:80%}.mw-parser-output .banner-box-left,.mw-parser-output .banner-box-right{padding:8px 7px;background:rgb(16,16,16);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);border-radius:4px;width:40%}.mw-parser-output .banner-box-left{text-align:le